# CODEOWNERS
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# This file is the authoritative source for code review routing.
# The `docs-suggest.yml` workflow reads this file and suggests reviewers
# on PRs that touch the paths listed here. Update this file directly;
# do not embed a copy in any other document.
#
# Convention: AyniCollective uses GitHub Teams for ownership.
# Each team maps to a role described in CONTRIBUTING.md.
# The repository owner must create the teams listed below in the
# GitHub organization settings before CODEOWNERS enforcement activates.
# Until teams exist, GitHub silently ignores unmatched rules and the
# `docs-suggest.yml` workflow falls back to shell-only matching.

# Default owners for everything not explicitly listed below.
/                              @ayni-collective/founders

# Governance — only founders may change the constitution or its companion files.
AGENTS.md                      @ayni-collective/founders
CLAUDE.md                      @ayni-collective/founders
HANDOFF.md                     @ayni-collective/founders
CONTEXT.md                     @ayni-collective/founders
README.md                      @ayni-collective/founders
CONTRIBUTING.md                @ayni-collective/founders
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md             @ayni-collective/founders
SECURITY.md                    @ayni-collective/founders
LICENSE                        @ayni-collective/founders

# Architecture — research, ADRs, and design docs.
/docs/adr/                     @ayni-collective/architecture
/docs/research/                @ayni-collective/architecture
/docs/design/                  @ayni-collective/architecture

# Skills — each skill's author owns that skill's content and scripts.
# Add a new line per skill, mapping to the skill's maintainer team.
/.agents/skills/research-topic/SKILL.md  @ayni-collective/skills-research-topic
/.agents/skills/tdd/SKILL.md             @ayni-collective/skills-tdd
/.agents/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md         @ayni-collective/skills-ponytail
/.agents/skills/code-quality/SKILL.md     @ayni-collective/skills-code-quality
/.agents/skills/gold-standard/SKILL.md   @ayni-collective/skills-gold-standard
/.agents/skills/planning-philosophy/SKILL.md  @ayni-collective/skills-planning

# CI — workflows and OSS gate configuration.
/.github/workflows/            @ayni-collective/ci-maintainers
/.github/workflows/docs-suggest.yml  @ayni-collective/ci-maintainers
/.github/workflows/oss-gate.yml     @ayni-collective/ci-maintainers
/.github/CODEOWNERS            @ayni-collective/founders  # meta — founders may change ownership routing
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/       @ayni-collective/founders
/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md  @ayni-collective/founders

